  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Right then, what's brought you in?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "It's my left heel, it's agony first thing when I put my foot down."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "And did it start after anything in particular?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I started a new job on a shop floor, standing all day, on concrete."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "It eases off once I've walked about a bit, then it's bad again by teatime."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look. It's tender right on the inside of the heel bone, and your calf is pretty tight."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "I think you have plantar fasciitis, it's very common in people on their feet all day."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Roll your foot over a frozen water bottle for five minutes before bed, and wear trainers with a decent heel at work, not flat shoes."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Grand, I'll give it a go."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Lovely, ta-ra for now, see you in three weeks."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Right, Shaz, come in love, sit yourself down."},
    {"role": "next_patient", "text": "Ta. My back's gone again, I bent down to pick up the dog's bowl and it locked."}
  ],
